{"reviewId": "9939836_88cu18o65", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "80、90就是夹心饼干，夹在70与00的中间，感觉错失了好多，然后又踩了好多的坑，政策红利确实也都没有赶上。你要知道哦阳光总在风雨后，耐心等待，2030年会是80、90最高光的时刻，前提也是要看的懂康波周期！", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "6602-6691", "abstract": "我们这一代和“70后”的命运是最好的，“00后”也是最好的，1980年到2000年出生的人命运是最差的，因为既赶不上前面的技术创新周期，也赶不上商品周期，更赶不上下一个商品周期。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 21, "chapterName": "16 一波三折 周期反弹节奏研究", "chapterIdx": 21, "reviewId": "9939836_88cu18o65", "userVid": 9939836, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775602865, "userEditTime": 1775603172, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "16 一波三折 周期反弹节奏研究", "author": {"userVid": 9939836, "name": "阿福", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-tsqpw2gUD5g029u8QRpR4f2/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书 运动 旅行", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "为中华之崛起而读书。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 27, "likes": [{"userVid": 9939836, "name": "阿福", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0012-tsqpw2gUD5g029u8QRpR4f2/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "读书 运动 旅行", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "为中华之崛起而读书。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "虽然但是，是不是有点盲目乐观了，90后都超一半30+的年纪了，是一个去企业都会被嫌弃的年纪，更何谈80后，“最高光的时刻”何来一说？", "reviewId": "9939836_88c